	// The box IS the run's horizontal leg — same number the path is drawn from — so centring the text
	// inside it centres the text on the arrow, at every width and whatever the label says.
	// Set in caps, which is what separates a label on a line from the prose in the cards either side
	// of it without needing a second colour or a rule.
